# Route: guide 40 of 49 of the simulator's completionist route for Orc (1199
# of 1215 eligible quests, 157.3 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 57 to 58, 37
# quests, 4.0 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Swamp of Sorrows, Winterspring, Desolace): Stonard -> Fallow Sanctuary
# -> Itharius's Cave -> Splinterspear Junction -> Stonard -> Splinterspear
# Junction -> Stonard -> Stagalbog -> Stonard -> Pool of Tears -> Stonard ->
# Misty Reed Strand -> Splinterspear Junction -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): Nothing But The Truth (1383;
# Deepstrider Giant 38-39, Deepstrider Searcher 39-40); Khan Hratha (1380;
# Khan Hratha 42); Shadowshard Fragments (7068; Shadowshard Rumbler 40-41,
# Shadowshard Smasher 41-42, Shadowshard Thunderer 38).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Blood of the Black Dragon Champion (6602), Vyletongue
# Corruption (7029), Legends of Maraudon (7044), Corruption of Earth and Seed
# (7064), The Pariah's Instructions (7067).

